      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "High-resolution mode",
      "source_hash": 12703608863776524150,
      "context_hash": 14599008646314169553,
      "translation": "고해상도 모드",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:39:50.191359Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "On boot, the kernel operates in **low-resolution mode** where timer interrupts fire at HZ rate (100–1000/s).",
      "source_hash": 848814034708617817,
      "context_hash": 10631855399296949872,
      "translation": "부팅 시 커널은 타이머 인터럽트가 HZ 주기(100–1000/s)로 발생하는 **저해상도 모드**로 동작합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "interrupt": "인터럽트"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:39:50.191359Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "When the first hrtimer device is detected, the system switches to **high-resolution mode**:",
      "source_hash": 699197411906197114,
      "context_hash": 17893156152469642744,
      "translation": "첫 번째 hrtimer 디바이스가 감지되면 시스템은 **고해상도 모드**로 전환합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "device": "디바이스",
        "hrtimer": "hrtimer"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:35:22.712162Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "After switching:",
      "source_hash": 4859734456019448383,
      "context_hash": 6411005045670577667,
      "translation": "전환 후:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:39:50.191360Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "The scheduler tick is implemented via an hrtimer (no longer a fixed-rate interrupt)",
      "source_hash": 13542393679184256970,
      "context_hash": 9229014445971637921,
      "translation": "스케줄러 틱이 hrtimer를 통해 구현됩니다(더 이상 고정 주기 인터럽트가 아님)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "hrtimer": "hrtimer",
        "interrupt": "인터럽트",
        "scheduler": "스케줄러"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:39:50.191360Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "Timer resolution is limited only by hardware latency (~100ns typical)",
      "source_hash": 16992451086267741726,
      "context_hash": 17146428559440025669,
      "translation": "타이머 해상도는 하드웨어 지연 시간에 의해서만 제한됩니다(일반적으로 ~100ns)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "hardware": "하드웨어",
        "latency": "지연 시간",
        "timer": "타이머"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:39:50.191361Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "`NOHZ` (tickless idle) can skip ticks entirely when CPU is idle",
      "source_hash": 273301593276755945,
      "context_hash": 15512739445376273330,
      "translation": "`NOHZ`(tickless idle)는 CPU가 유휴 상태일 때 틱을 완전히 건너뛸 수 있습니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CPU": "CPU"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:39:50.191361Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "NOHZ: tickless operation",
      "source_hash": 10749496959339544174,
      "context_hash": 16313299625172644288,
      "translation": "NOHZ: tickless 동작",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:39:50.191361Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "With `CONFIG_NO_HZ_IDLE` (default), when all runqueue tasks sleep and no hrtimers are pending soon, the tick stops entirely:",
      "source_hash": 3839984084199147727,
      "context_hash": 919585837023548879,
      "translation": "`CONFIG_NO_HZ_IDLE`(기본값)에서는 런큐의 모든 태스크가 잠들어 있고 곧 만료될 hrtimer가 없으면 tick이 완전히 멈춥니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "hrtimer": "hrtimer",
        "runqueue": "런큐"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:39:55.541834Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "With `CONFIG_NO_HZ_FULL` (for real-time/HPC), ticks also stop for CPUs with only one running task — eliminating ~1000 interrupts/second of OS noise.",
      "source_hash": 14223351764056587485,
      "context_hash": 4014668498398723326,
      "translation": "`CONFIG_NO_HZ_FULL`(실시간/HPC용)에서는 실행 중인 태스크가 하나뿐인 CPU에서도 tick이 멈추므로, 초당 ~1000회에 달하는 OS 노이즈 인터럽트가 사라집니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CPU": "CPU",
        "interrupt": "인터럽트"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:39:55.541835Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Timer slack",
      "source_hash": 17047174618900126444,
      "context_hash": 3311597259597926033,
      "translation": "타이머 슬랙(timer slack)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "timer": "타이머"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:39:55.541836Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "`nanosleep` and similar calls can be coalesced with nearby wakeups to reduce power consumption.",
      "source_hash": 9894723592200592776,
      "context_hash": 5035016521748752748,
      "translation": "`nanosleep` 및 이와 유사한 호출은 전력 소비를 줄이기 위해 인접한 웨이크업과 병합될 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:39:55.541836Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "The kernel applies a **slack** — allowed slippage past the requested time:",
      "source_hash": 1308044403825384370,
      "context_hash": 2953043764531207085,
      "translation": "커널은 요청된 시간을 넘어 허용되는 지연인 **슬랙**을 적용합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "kernel": "커널"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:39:55.541836Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "The default slack is a fixed constant (`.timer_slack_ns = 50000` in `init/init_task.c`), equating to 50µs.",
      "source_hash": 13709266957576488980,
      "context_hash": 16035918267582738433,
      "translation": "기본 슬랙은 고정 상수(`init/init_task.c`의 `.timer_slack_ns = 50000`)로, 50µs에 해당합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:39:55.541837Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:3/seg:1",
      "source": "Setting slack=0 disables coalescing — useful for real-time tasks that need precise wakeup.",
      "source_hash": 5206833499085790557,
      "context_hash": 5126535716696866538,
      "translation": "slack=0으로 설정하면 병합이 비활성화되며, 정확한 웨이크업이 필요한 실시간 태스크에 유용합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:39:55.541837Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:0/seg:0",
